@startuml states_alert
' SIMPA - States: Alert lifecycle (RF-12, RF-31)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam StateBorderColor #006633

[*] --> Open : positive diagnosis\nor incident reported

Open : visible to the responsible role
Open --> InProgress : the responsible person\ntakes it on [RF-31]
Open --> Escalated : exceeds the deadline\nwithout action

Escalated : notifies general administration
Escalated --> InProgress : a responsible person is assigned

InProgress : pending field verification
InProgress --> Verified : on-site verification\n(up to 2 visits/week, EV-07)
InProgress --> Discarded : model false positive

Verified --> InTreatment : corrective action applied
Verified --> Closed : no action required

InTreatment --> Closed : issue resolved
InTreatment --> Reopened : persists after treatment

Reopened --> InProgress

Closed --> [*]
Discarded --> [*]

note right of Discarded
  False positives feed the
  model's retraining process
  (RNF-15, RNF-17).
end note
@enduml
